#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0160 expect=violation domain=ADLBC
#note "EMPTY-DATASET PIN, expectation CORRECTED at stage-G escalation. AWU/AWLO declared (AWHI absent - the firing shape), zero rows. The Check is 100% dataset-constant, so BroadcastFold.fold decides it against the declared column schema BEFORE the 0-row synthetic zero-column table is ever built: var_exists(AWU) and (not var_exists(AWLO) or not var_exists(AWHI)) folds TRUE -> datasetBroadcastResult emits exactly one violation, reported at row=1 (no value pin - a zero-row table yields an empty extracted value). Was PMDA-AD0160-valid_empty_dataset-ADLBC.cdt / expect=noViolation / count=0; renamed and inverted, not duplicated."
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AWU     type=Char
col AWLO    type=Num
